{"clase": "<h4>El problema de transporte</h4>\n<p>Enviar unidades desde m orígenes (oferta o<sub>i</sub>) a n destinos (demanda d<sub>j</sub>) al mínimo costo. x<sub>ij</sub> = unidades de i a j.</p>\n<p>Min Z = ΣΣ c<sub>ij</sub>x<sub>ij</sub>; s.a. Σ<sub>j</sub> x<sub>ij</sub> = o<sub>i</sub>; Σ<sub>i</sub> x<sub>ij</sub> = d<sub>j</sub>; x<sub>ij</sub> ≥ 0. Hay <b>m + n − 1</b> variables básicas.</p>\n<h4>Balancear (Paso 1 del algoritmo)</h4>\n<div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Caso</th><th>Se agrega</th><th>Costo en el ficticio</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><th>Oferta &gt; Demanda</th><td>destino ficticio</td><td>0 si da lo mismo · costo de almacenaje/fabricación · <b>M</b> si ese origen no puede quedarse con unidades</td></tr>\n<tr><th>Demanda &gt; Oferta</th><td>origen ficticio</td><td>0 · multa por unidad no enviada · <b>M</b> si el cliente exige toda su demanda</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<ul><li>Ruta prohibida (puente cortado, no se desea enviar): costo <b>M</b>.</li>\n<li>Si hay costos de producción por planta, se <b>suman</b> al costo de transporte de esa fila.</li></ul>", "ejemplos": [{"q": "<p>Tres depósitos abastecen a cuatro almacenes. Costos unitarios, capacidades y requerimientos:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>1</th><th>2</th><th>3</th><th>4</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>4</td><td>4</td><td>120</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td>4</td><td>8</td><td>3</td><td>6</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td>6</td><td>7</td><td>8</td><td>3</td><td>150</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>120</td><td>150</td><td>100</td><td>80</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Un puente dañado impide enviar de A al almacén 2 y de B al almacén 4. Cada unidad que no se transporta cuesta $2, $5 y $3 de almacenaje en A, B y C. (Ejemplo del apunte \"Algoritmo de Transporte-Transbordo\".)</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Construya la tabla de transporte balanceada.</li><li><b>b)</b> Encuentre una SBF inicial por Vogel.</li><li><b>c)</b> Encuentre la solución óptima y diga si hay soluciones múltiples.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Tabla de transporte</h5><p>Oferta total = 470, demanda total = 450. Sobra oferta ⇒ se agrega un <b>destino ficticio</b> con demanda 20.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>1</th><th>2</th><th>3</th><th>4</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td>2</td><td>M</td><td>4</td><td>4</td><td>2</td><td>120</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td>4</td><td>8</td><td>3</td><td>M</td><td>5</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td>6</td><td>7</td><td>8</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>150</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>120</td><td>150</td><td>100</td><td>80</td><td>20</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Solución</h5><p><b>Vogel:</b> penalidad = diferencia entre los dos costos menores de cada fila y columna; en la línea con mayor penalidad se asigna a la celda más barata.</p><ol class=\"log\"><li>Mayor penalidad = 2 (columna 1); se asigna 120 a la celda (1,1) de costo 2.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 2 (fila 1); se asigna 0 a la celda (1,5) de costo 2.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = M−3 (columna 4); se asigna 80 a la celda (3,4) de costo 3.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 5 (columna 3); se asigna 100 a la celda (2,3) de costo 3.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 4 (fila 3); se asigna 20 a la celda (3,5) de costo 3.</li><li>Queda una sola fila o columna: se completa con el método del costo menor.</li></ol><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>1</th><th>2</th><th>3</th><th>4</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th class=\"pen\">Penal.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">120</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">120</td><td class=\"pen\">0/2</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"pen\">1/2/2/2/3</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">80</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"pen\">0/0/0/4/4</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">120</td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"sd\">80</td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th class=\"pen\">Penal.</th><td class=\"pen\">2</td><td class=\"pen\">1/1/1/1/1</td><td class=\"pen\">1/1/5/5</td><td class=\"pen\">1/1/M−3</td><td class=\"pen\">1/1/2/2/2</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 2·120 + 8·100 + 3·100 + 7·50 + 3·80 + 3·20 = <b>1990</b>.</p><p><b>Algoritmo de transporte (u<sub>i</sub>, v<sub>j</sub>):</b></p><p class=\"it\">Iteración 1. Se fija u<sub>3</sub> = 0 (la fila/columna con más celdas básicas) y se resuelve u<sub>i</sub> + v<sub>j</sub> = c<sub>ij</sub> en las básicas. Costos reducidos c<sub>ij</sub> − u<sub>i</sub> − v<sub>j</sub> de las no básicas: todos ≥ 0 ⇒ <b>solución óptima</b>. Z = 2·120 + 8·100 + 3·100 + 7·50 + 3·80 + 3·20 = <b>1990</b></p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>1</th><th>2</th><th>3</th><th>4</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">120</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span><span class=\"rd\">M−6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">120</td><td class=\"uv\">−1</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span><span class=\"rd\">M−4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">1</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">80</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">120</td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"sd\">80</td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">3</td><td class=\"uv\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">2</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución óptima:</b> A → 1: 120; B → 2: 100; B → 3: 100; C → 2: 50; C → 4: 80; C → Fic: 20. Z* = <b>1990</b>.</p><p><b>¿Soluciones múltiples?</b> Sí: la celda no básica (B,1) tiene costo reducido 0. Si entra (θ = 20) se obtiene otra solución con el mismo Z:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>1</th><th>2</th><th>3</th><th>4</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">120</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">80</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">70</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">80</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">120</td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"sd\">80</td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 2·100 + 2·20 + 4·20 + 8·80 + 3·100 + 7·70 + 3·80 = <b>1990</b>.</p></div>", "intro": "Este ejemplo junta todo: rutas prohibidas (M), destino ficticio con costos de almacenaje, Vogel, u-v y soluciones múltiples. El profesor obtiene Z = 1990."}], "ejercicios": [{"q": "<p>Una fábrica tiene tres centros de distribución A, B y C con 100, 100 y 120 toneladas. Debe entregarlas a cinco almacenes I–V que requieren 40, 50, 70, 90 y 90 toneladas. Si no se satisface la demanda, cuesta 4, 6, 6, 8 y 3 por tonelada en los almacenes I–V. Costos:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>I</th><th>II</th><th>III</th><th>IV</th><th>V</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td>10</td><td>20</td><td>5</td><td>9</td><td>10</td><td>100</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td>3</td><td>11</td><td>8</td><td>30</td><td>5</td><td>100</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td>1</td><td>20</td><td>7</td><td>10</td><td>4</td><td>120</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>40</td><td>50</td><td>70</td><td>90</td><td>90</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"src\">Guía de transporte resuelta, Problema 2 (certamen 2013-1).</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Construya la tabla balanceada.</li><li><b>b)</b> SBF inicial por Esquina Nor-Oeste.</li><li><b>c)</b> Solución óptima.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Tabla de transporte</h5><p>Oferta total = 320, demanda total = 340. Falta oferta ⇒ se agrega un <b>origen ficticio</b> con oferta 20.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>I</th><th>II</th><th>III</th><th>IV</th><th>V</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td>10</td><td>20</td><td>5</td><td>9</td><td>10</td><td>100</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td>3</td><td>11</td><td>8</td><td>30</td><td>5</td><td>100</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td>1</td><td>20</td><td>7</td><td>10</td><td>4</td><td>120</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td>4</td><td>6</td><td>6</td><td>8</td><td>3</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>40</td><td>50</td><td>70</td><td>90</td><td>90</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Solución</h5><p><b>Esquina Nor-Oeste:</b> se parte en la celda (1,1), se asigna lo máximo y se avanza a la derecha o hacia abajo según se agote la demanda o la oferta.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>I</th><th>II</th><th>III</th><th>IV</th><th>V</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">40</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span></td><td class=\"sd\">100</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">60</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">30</span><span class=\"al\">40</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span></td><td class=\"sd\">100</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"al\">70</span></td><td class=\"sd\">120</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"sd\">70</td><td class=\"sd\">90</td><td class=\"sd\">90</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 10·40 + 20·50 + 5·10 + 8·60 + 30·40 + 10·50 + 4·70 + 3·20 = <b>3970</b>. Celdas básicas: 8 = m + n − 1 = 4+5−1.</p><p><b>Algoritmo de transporte (u<sub>i</sub>, v<sub>j</sub>):</b></p><p class=\"it\">Iteración 1. Se fija u<sub>1</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (2,5) con −19 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (2,5)+ → (2,4)− → (3,4)+ → (3,5)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 40 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (2,4). Z actual = 3970.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>I</th><th>II</th><th>III</th><th>IV</th><th>V</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">40</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−18</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−11</span></td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">60</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">30</span><span class=\"al\">40</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−19</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">1</span><span class=\"rd\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">17</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"rd\">19</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">50</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"al\">70</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td class=\"sd\">120</td><td class=\"uv\">−17</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"rd\">12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd\">19</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">−18</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"sd\">70</td><td class=\"sd\">90</td><td class=\"sd\">90</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td class=\"uv\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">5</td><td class=\"uv\">27</td><td class=\"uv\">21</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 2. Se fija u<sub>1</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (4,2) con −15 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (4,2)+ → (4,5)− → (2,5)+ → (2,3)− → (1,3)+ → (1,2)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 20 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (4,5). Z actual = 3210.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>I</th><th>II</th><th>III</th><th>IV</th><th>V</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">40</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"al\">50</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">10</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"rd\">8</span></td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">60</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">30</span><span class=\"rd\">19</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">40</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">1</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−11</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">90</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"al\">30</span></td><td class=\"sd\">120</td><td class=\"uv\">2</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−7</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−15</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">20</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">1</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"sd\">70</td><td class=\"sd\">90</td><td class=\"sd\">90</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td class=\"uv\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">5</td><td class=\"uv\">8</td><td class=\"uv\">2</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 3. Se fija u<sub>1</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (2,2) con −12 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (2,2)+ → (2,3)− → (1,3)+ → (1,2)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 30 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (1,2). Z actual = 2910.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>I</th><th>II</th><th>III</th><th>IV</th><th>V</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<