ass=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"rd\">11</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">90</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">120</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd\">14</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">−4</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"sd\">70</td><td class=\"sd\">90</td><td class=\"sd\">90</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">1</td><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td class=\"uv\">−4</td><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td class=\"uv\">4</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 6. Se fija u<sub>3</sub> = 0 (la fila/columna con más celdas básicas) y se resuelve u<sub>i</sub> + v<sub>j</sub> = c<sub>ij</sub> en las básicas. Costos reducidos c<sub>ij</sub> − u<sub>i</sub> − v<sub>j</sub> de las no básicas: todos ≥ 0 ⇒ <b>solución óptima</b>. Z = 5·70 + 9·30 + 11·30 + 5·70 + 1·40 + 10·60 + 4·20 + 6·20 = <b>2140</b></p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>I</th><th>II</th><th>III</th><th>IV</th><th>V</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"rd\">10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">11</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">70</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">30</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"uv\">−1</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">30</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">30</span><span class=\"rd\">19</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">70</span></td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"uv\">1</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">1</span><span class=\"al\">40</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">60</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">120</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">−4</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"sd\">70</td><td class=\"sd\">90</td><td class=\"sd\">90</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">1</td><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td class=\"uv\">6</td><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td class=\"uv\">4</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución óptima:</b> A → III: 70; A → IV: 30; B → II: 30; B → V: 70; C → I: 40; C → IV: 60; C → V: 20; Fic → II: 20. Z* = <b>2140</b>.</p><p><b>¿Soluciones múltiples?</b> No: todos los costos reducidos de las celdas no básicas son estrictamente positivos ⇒ la solución es única.</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p>Tres fábricas A, B, C producen 50, 70 y 40 toneladas. Los almacenes 1 y 2 deben recibir 80 y 60. Por cada tonelada que no se envía, las fábricas pagan 4, 3 y 5 pesos. Costos:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Alm. 1</th><th>Alm. 2</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td>10</td><td>20</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td>18</td><td>11</td><td>70</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td>12</td><td>20</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>80</td><td>60</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"src\">C2 2023-1, Problema 3 a).</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Construya la tabla balanceada.</li><li><b>b)</b> SBF inicial por Esquina Nor-Oeste y solución óptima.</li><li><b>c)</b> ¿Hay soluciones múltiples? Justifique.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Tabla de transporte</h5><p>Oferta total = 160, demanda total = 140. Sobra oferta ⇒ se agrega un <b>destino ficticio</b> con demanda 20.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Alm. 1</th><th>Alm. 2</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td>10</td><td>20</td><td>4</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td>18</td><td>11</td><td>3</td><td>70</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td>12</td><td>20</td><td>5</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>80</td><td>60</td><td>20</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Solución</h5><p><b>Esquina Nor-Oeste:</b> se parte en la celda (1,1), se asigna lo máximo y se avanza a la derecha o hacia abajo según se agote la demanda o la oferta.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Alm. 1</th><th>Alm. 2</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span></td><td class=\"sd\">50</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">18</span><span class=\"al\">30</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">40</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">70</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">40</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">80</td><td class=\"sd\">60</td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 10·50 + 18·30 + 11·40 + 20·20 + 5·20 = <b>1980</b>. Celdas básicas: 5 = m + n − 1 = 3+3−1.</p><p><b>Algoritmo de transporte (u<sub>i</sub>, v<sub>j</sub>):</b></p><p class=\"it\">Iteración 1. Se fija u<sub>2</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (3,1) con −15 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (3,1)+ → (3,2)− → (2,2)+ → (2,1)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 20 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (3,2). Z actual = 1980.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Alm. 1</th><th>Alm. 2</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">17</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"rd\">16</span></td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"uv\">−8</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">18</span><span class=\"al\">30</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">40</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td class=\"sd\">70</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−15</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"al\">20</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td class=\"uv\">9</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">80</td><td class=\"sd\">60</td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">18</td><td class=\"uv\">11</td><td class=\"uv\">−4</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 2. Se fija v<sub>1</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (2,3) con −8 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (2,3)+ → (2,1)− → (3,1)+ → (3,3)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 10 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (2,1). Z actual = 1680.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Alm. 1</th><th>Alm. 2</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">17</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"uv\">10</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">18</span><span class=\"al\">10</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">60</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−8</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td class=\"sd\">70</td><td class=\"uv\">18</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"al\">20</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">15</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">20</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td class=\"uv\">12</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">80</td><td class=\"sd\">60</td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td class=\"uv\">−7</td><td class=\"uv\">−7</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 3. Se fija u<sub>2</sub> = 0 (la fila/columna con más celdas básicas) y se resuelve u<sub>i</sub> + v<sub>j</sub> = c<sub>ij</sub> en las básicas. Costos reducidos c<sub>ij</sub> − u<sub>i</sub> − v<sub>j</sub> de las no básicas: todos ≥ 0 ⇒ <b>solución óptima</b>. Z = 10·50 + 11·60 + 3·10 + 12·30 + 5·10 = <b>1600</b></p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Alm. 1</th><th>Alm. 2</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">9</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">18</span><span class=\"rd\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">60</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">10</span></td><td class=\"sd\">70</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"al\">30</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">10</span></td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td class=\"uv\">2</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">80</td><td class=\"sd\">60</td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td class=\"uv\">11</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución óptima:</b> A → Alm. 1: 50; B → Alm. 2: 60; B → Fic: 10; C → Alm. 1: 30; C → Fic: 10. Z* = <b>1600</b>.</p><p><b>¿Soluciones múltiples?</b> No: todos los costos reducidos de las celdas no básicas son estrictamente positivos ⇒ la solución es única.</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p>Considere el siguiente problema de transporte (costos unitarios):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td>20</td><td>6</td><td>13</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td>15</td><td>14</td><td>14</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td>9</td><td>15</td><td>9</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>10</td><td>60</td><td>50</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>El destino D2 exige recibir toda su demanda; a los demás da lo mismo que les falte.</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Construya la tabla balanceada.</li><li><b>b)</b> SBF inicial por Vogel y solución óptima.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Tabla de transporte</h5><p>Oferta total = 90, demanda total = 120. Falta oferta ⇒ se agrega un <b>origen ficticio</b> con oferta 30.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td>20</td><td>6</td><td>13</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td>15</td><td>14</td><td>14</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td>9</td><td>15</td><td>9</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td>0</td><td>M</td><td>0</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>10</td><td>60</td><td>50</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Solución</h5><p><b>Vogel:</b> penalidad = diferencia entre los dos costos menores de cada fila y columna; en la línea con mayor penalidad se asigna a la celda más barata.</p><ol class=\"log\"><li>Mayor penalidad = 9 (columna 1); se asigna 10 a la celda (4,1) de costo 0.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = M (fila 4); se asigna 20 a la celda (4,3) de costo 0.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 8 (columna 2); se asigna 20 a la celda (1,2) de costo 6.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 6 (fila 3); se asigna 30 a la celda (3,3) de costo 9.</li><li>Queda una sola fila o columna: se completa con el método del costo menor.</li></ol><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>Oferta</th><th class=\"pen\">Penal.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">13</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"pen\">7/7/7</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"pen\">0/0/0/0</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">30</span></td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"pen\">0/6/6/6</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">30</td><td class=\"pen\">0/M</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">10</td><td class=\"sd\">60</td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th class=\"pen\">Penal.</th><td class=\"pen\">9</td><td class=\"pen\">8/8/8/1</td><td class=\"pen\">9/9/4/5</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 6·20 + 14·20 + 15·20 + 9·30 + 0·10 + 0·20 = <b>970</b>.</p><p><b>Algoritmo de transporte (u<sub>i</sub>, v<sub>j</sub>):</b></p><p class=\"it\">Iteración 1. Se fija v<sub>2</sub> = 0 (la fila/columna con más celdas básicas) y se resuelve u<sub>i</sub> + v<sub>j</sub> = c<sub>ij</sub> en las básicas. Costos reducidos c<sub>ij</sub> − u<sub>i</sub> − v<sub>j</sub> de las no básicas: todos ≥ 0 ⇒ <b>solución óptima</b>. Z = 6·20 + 14·20 + 15·20 + 9·30 + 0·10 + 0·20 = <b>970</b></p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">13</span><span class=\"rd\">13</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">6</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">6</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">14</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">30</span></td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"uv\">15</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span><span class=\"rd\">M−6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">30</td><td class=\"uv\">6</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">10</td><td class=\"sd\">60</td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">−6</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td class=\"uv\">−6</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución óptima:</b> O1 → D2: 20; O2 → D2: 20; O3 → D2: 20; O3 → D3: 30; Fic → D1: 10; Fic → D3: 20. Z* = <b>970</b>.</p><p><b>¿Soluciones múltiples?</b> Sí: la celda no básica (O3,D1) tiene costo reducido 0. Si entra (θ = 10) se obtiene otra solución con el mismo Z:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">13</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">50</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">30</span></td><td class=\"sd\">30</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">10</td><td class=\"sd\">60</td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 6·20 + 14·20 + 9·10 + 15·20 + 9·20 + 0·30 = <b>970</b>.</p></div>"}]}